#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.view_page_home
msgid ""
"\"A MacBook Air at half price, delivered in 48 hours, with a 12-month "
"warranty. It's exactly what I needed for college.\""
msgstr ""
"\"MacBook Air ເຄິ່ງລາຄາ, ຈັດສົ່ງພາຍໃນ 48 ຊົ່ວໂມງ, ພ້ອມຮັບປະກັນ 12 ເດືອນ. ມັນແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ຂ້ອຍຕ້ອງກ"
"ານແທ້ໆສຳລັບການຮຽນມະຫາວິທະຍາໄລ.\""

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.view_page_home
msgid ""
"\"I received a Grade A iPhone 13, it's in absolutely perfect condition. You "
"can't tell it apart from a brand-new one. I recommend it 100%!\""
msgstr ""
"\"ຂ້ອຍໄດ້ຮັບ iPhone 13 ເກຣດ A, ສະພາບສົມບູນແບບແທ້ໆ. ແຍກບໍ່ອອກເລີຍວ່າມັນຕ່າງຈາກເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ແນວໃ"
"ດ. ແນະນຳເລີຍ 100%!\""

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.view_page_home
msgid ""
"\"We provide equipment to our 40 employees through RELOOP. The value for "
"money is unbeatable, and the B2B service is excellent.\""
msgstr ""
"\"ພວກເຮົາຈັດຫາອຸປະກອນໃຫ້ພະນັກງານ 40 ຄົນຜ່ານ RELOOP. ຄຸ້ມຄ່າສຸດໆ ແລະ ການບໍລິການ B2B ກໍດີເລີດແທ້"
"ໆ.\""

