#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.view_page_our_company
msgid ""
"<span class=\"o_animated_text o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_visible "
"o_anim_from_left\" style=\"--wanim-intensity: 5; animation-delay: 0.6s;"
"\">RELOOP was founded in 2018 based on the belief that the best devices "
"shouldn't end up in the trash after just two years. Since then, we have "
"refurbished more than 50,000 devices and reduced thousands of metric tons of "
"electronic waste.</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"o_animated_text o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_visible "
"o_anim_from_left\" style=\"--wanim-intensity: 5; animation-delay: 0.6s;\">"
"RELOOP ຖືກກໍ່ຕັ້ງຂຶ້ນໃນປີ 2018 ບົນພື້ນຖານຄວາມເຊື່ອທີ່ວ່າ ອຸປະກອນທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດບໍ່ຄວນກາຍເປັນຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອຫຼັງຈາກນຳໃຊ້ພ"
"ຽງແຕ່ສອງປີ. ນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ນັ້ນມາ, ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ປັບປຸງອຸປະກອນໃໝ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ 50,000 ເຄື່ອງ ແລະ ຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອເອ"
"ເລັກໂຕຣນິກໄດ້ຫຼາຍພັນໂຕນ.</span>"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<span class=\"o_animated_text o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_visible "
"o_anim_from_left\" style=\"--wanim-intensity: 5; animation-duration: 0.6s;"
"\">Top-of-the-line devices that have been tested, certified and covered by a "
"warranty, up to 60% cheaper than new. Good for your budget, better for the "
"planet.</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"o_animated_text o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_visible "
"o_anim_from_left\" style=\"--wanim-intensity: 5; animation-duration: 0.6s;\">"
"ອຸປະກອນຊັ້ນນຳທີ່ຜ່ານການທົດສອບ, ຢັ້ງຢືນ ແລະ ຄຸ້ມຄອງດ້ວຍການຮັບປະກັນ, ລາຄາຖືກກວ່າເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ສູງສຸດເຖິງ "
"60%. ດີຕໍ່ເງິນໃນຖົງຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ດີກວ່າຕໍ່ໂລກຂອງພວກເຮົາ.</span>"

