msgstr "ສ້າງໃບບິນຜູ້ສະໜອງ"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Create a new manufacturing order directly from the <strong>Manufacturing "
"app</strong> to initiate the teardown process."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດໃໝ່ໂດຍກົງຈາກ <strong>ແອັບການຜະລິດ</strong> ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂັ້ນຕອນການແຍກຊິ້ນສ່ວນ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_5
msgid ""
"Custom-finished body panel utilizing a high-durability coating in deep plum, "
"silver or green for a uniform, sleek corporate look."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເຄື່ອງຕົກແຕ່ງພິເສດດ້ວຍການເຄືອບຜິວທີ່ມີຄວາມທົນທານສູງ ໃນສີມ່ວງໝາກຫວ້າເຂັ້ມ, ສີເງິນ ຫຼື ສີຂຽວ ເພື່ອຄວາມ"
"ສວຍງາມ ແລະ ເປັນເອກະພາບຂອງອົງກອນ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_4
msgid ""
"Custom-finished body panel utilizing a high-durability coating, in deep "
