#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_4
msgid ""
"Elevate your company culture. The GameX Extreme is a fantastic tool for "
"casual networking, breaking the ice during corporate retreats, or setting up "
"a dedicated relaxation zone in the office to spark creativity and "
"collaboration."
msgstr ""
"ຍົກລະດັບວັດທະນະທຳອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ. GameX Extreme ເປັນເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ດີເລີດສຳລັບການສ້າງຄວາມສຳພັນ, ການ"
"ລະລາຍພຶດຕິກຳໃນງານສຳມະນາຂອງບໍລິສັດ, ຫຼື ການຈັດມຸມພັກຜ່ອນໃນຫ້ອງການເພື່ອສ້າງແຮງບັນດານໃຈ ແລະ ການຮ່"
"ວມມື."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.view_page_home
msgid "Email Address"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວ"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Empowering your business with Odoo means securing your profit margins "
"through absolute traceability. It transforms operational headaches, like the "
"VAT margin scheme and serial number management, into automated, background "
"processes, freeing your team to focus on scaling your catalog and delivering "
"premium quality tech to your customers."
msgstr ""
"ການສ້າງຄວາມເຂັ້ມແຂງໃຫ້ທຸລະກິດຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍ Odoo ໝາຍເຖິງການຮັກສາອັດຕາກຳໄລຜ່ານການຕິດຕາມກວດສອບທີ່"
"ຊັດເຈນ. ມັນປ່ຽນຄວາມຫຍຸ້ງຍາກໃນການດຳເນີນງານ ເຊັ່ນ: ລະບົບອາກອນກຳໄລ (VAT margin scheme) ແລ"
"ະ ການຈັດການໝາຍເລກລຳດັບ (Serial Number) ໃຫ້ເປັນຂະບວນການອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທີມງານຂອງທ່ານມີ"
"ເວລາໄປສຸມໃສ່ການຂະຫຍາຍລາຍການສິນຄ້າ ແລະ ສົ່ງມອບອຸປະກອນຄຸນນະພາບສູງໃຫ້ແກ່ລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_5
msgid "Endurance Battery"
msgstr "ແບັດເຕີຣີໃຊ້ງານຍາວນານ"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Enforce strict tracking during the <b>Delivery</b> phase by capturing the "
"exact <b>serial number</b> of the sold product, maintaining perfect stock "
"order and permanently logging which customer owns which specific device."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດການຕິດຕາມຢ່າງເຂັ້ມງວດໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນ <b>ການຈັດສົ່ງ</b> ໂດຍການບັນທຶກ <b>ໝາຍເລກລຳດັບ "
"(Serial Number)</b> ທີ່ແນ່ນອນຂອງສິນຄ້າທີ່ຂາຍ, ຮັກສາຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງສາງສິນຄ້າ ແລະ ບັນທຶກໄວ້ຢ່າງຖ"
"າວອນວ່າລູກຄ້າຄົນໃດເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງອຸປະກອນໃດ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Ensure your reporting is completely accurate, as the total margin "
"calculation automatically accounts for both the <b>purchase</b> and "
"<b>sales</b> values during that specific period."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບປະກັນວ່າລາຍງານຂອງທ່ານຖືກຕ້ອງສົມບູນ, ເນື່ອງຈາກການຄິດໄລ່ກຳໄລລວມຈະຄຳນຶງເຖິງທັງມູນຄ່າ <b>ການຊື້</"
"b> ແລະ <b>ການຂາຍ</b> ໃນໄລຍະເວລານັ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_3
msgid "Enterprise Privacy Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວສຳລັບອົງກອນ"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_5
msgid ""
"Equip your workforce with a reliable, no-nonsense device engineered for "
"everyday business operations."
msgstr ""
"ຕິດຕັ້ງອຸປະກອນທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ ແລະ ເໝາະສົມກັບການເຮັດວຽກຕົວຈິງໃຫ້ແກ່ພະນັກງານຂອງທ່ານ ເຊິ່ງອອກແບບມາສຳລັບກ"
"ານດຳເນີນທຸລະກິດປະຈຳວັນ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_10
msgid ""
"Equipped with advanced noise-suppression microphones and fine-tuned dynamic "
"drivers, the Airphones adapt to any listening environment."
msgstr ""
"ມາພ້ອມກັບໄມໂຄຣໂຟນຕັດສຽງລົບກວນຂັ້ນສູງ ແລະ ດອກລຳໂພງໄດນາມິກທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງມາຢ່າງດີ, Airphones ສາມາດ"
"ປັບຕົວເຂົ້າກັບທຸກສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການຟັງ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_5
msgid ""
"Equipped with an optimized battery cell designed to easily last through full "
"warehouse shifts, delivery routes, or long days in the field."
msgstr ""
"ມາພ້ອມກັບແບັດເຕີຣີທີ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຕະຫຼອດກະການເຮັດວຽກໃນສາງ, ເສັ້ນທາງການຈັດສົ່ງ, ຫຼື ການເຮັດວ"
"ຽກນອກສະຖານທີ່ຕະຫຼອດມື້."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_6
msgid ""
"Equipped with our revolutionary <b>7-lens rear array</b>, the Odoo Phone "
"20 adapts to any professional environment, eliminating the need for separate "
"digital cameras or handheld scanners."
msgstr ""
"ມາພ້ອມກັບ <b>ກ້ອງຫຼັງ 7 ເລນ</b> ອັນລ້ຳສະໄໝ, Odoo Phone 20 ສາມາດປັບຕົວເຂົ້າກັບທຸກສະພາບແວດລ້ອ"
"ມການເຮັດວຽກ, ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ກ້ອງດິຈິຕອນ ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງສະແກນມືຖືຕ່າງຫາກ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_5
msgid "Essential Single-Lens Rear Camera (Barcode Optimized)"
msgstr "ກ້ອງຫຼັງເລນດຽວທີ່ຈຳເປັນ (ປັບແຕ່ງມາສຳລັບບາໂຄ້ດ)"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Every refurbished smartphone prevents the emission of 70 kg of CO₂ and saves "
"13,000 liters of water. With RELOOP, you can consume more sustainably "
"without sacrificing quality."
msgstr ""
"ສະມາດໂຟນທີ່ປັບປຸງສະພາບແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນການປ່ອຍອາຍ CO₂ ໄດ້ເຖິງ 70 ກິໂລກຣາມ ແລະ ປະຢັດນ້ຳໄ"
"ດ້ 13,000 ລິດ. ດ້ວຍ RELOOP, ທ່ານສາມາດຊົມໃຊ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງຍືນຍົງຂຶ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄຸນນະພາບ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Execute your periodic regularization by creating a specific <b>Account Move</"
"b> (Journal Entry):"
msgstr ""
"ດຳເນີນການປັບປຸງບັນຊີຕາມຮອບໄລຍະເວລາໂດຍການສ້າງ <b>ລາຍການບັນຊີ</b> (Journal Entry) ສະເພາ"
"ະ:"

