"accurately valued in your active stock."
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມອັດສະລິຍະ ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວສິນຄ້າ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕິດຕາມການຍ້າຍສິນຄ້າຄົງສາງໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າ"
"ຊິ້ນສ່ວນທີ່ແຍກອອກມານັ້ນພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານທັນທີ ແລະ ຖືກປະເມີນມູນຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃນສາງສິນຄ້າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_3
msgid "The Smart Business Assistant"
msgstr "ຜູ້ຊ່ວຍທຸລະກິດອັດສະລິຍະ"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_4
msgid "The Ultimate Corporate Gaming Console"
msgstr "ສຸດຍອດເຄື່ອງເກມສຳລັບອົງກອນ"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_3
msgid ""
"The acoustic mesh is woven in a deep charcoal grey under a matte white "
"shell, a neutral finish that sits quietly in any workspace."
msgstr ""
"ຜ້າຕາໜ່າງລະບົບສຽງຖືກຖັກທໍດ້ວຍສີເທົາເຂັ້ມ ພາຍໃຕ້ຕົວເຄື່ອງສີຂາວດ້ານ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນໂທນສີກາງໆ ທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ດີກັບທຸ"
"ກພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The electronic refurbishment industry operates in a unique space within the "
"circular economy, requiring dynamic inventory tracking, complex variant "
"handling, and stringent tax compliance. Standard retail software often falls "
"short when dealing with second-hand goods, where every incoming device has a "
"distinct history, condition, and acquisition cost. Odoo bridges this gap by "
"providing an all-in-one ecosystem explicitly designed to manage the volatile "
"lifecycle of refurbished electronics."
msgstr ""
"ອຸດສາຫະກຳການປັບປຸງສະພາບອຸປະກອນເອເລັກໂຕຣນິກດຳເນີນງານໃນຮູບແບບພິເສດພາຍໃຕ້ເສດຖະກິດໝູນວຽນ, ເຊິ່ງ"
"ຕ້ອງການການຕິດຕາມສິນຄ້າຄົງສາງແບບຍືດຫຍຸ່ນ, ການຈັດການລຸ້ນຍ່ອຍທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ, ແລະ ການປະຕິບັດຕາມກົດໝາຍອາກ"
"ອນຢ່າງເຂັ້ມງວດ. ໂປຣແກຣມຂາຍຍ່ອຍທົ່ວໄປມັກຈະບໍ່ຕອບໂຈດເມື່ອນຳມາໃຊ້ກັບສິນຄ້າມືສອງ, ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະອຸປະກອນທີ່ຮັ"
"ບເຂົ້າມາມີປະຫວັດ, ສະພາບ ແລະ ຕົ້ນທຶນການຊື້ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. Odoo ຊ່ວຍແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ໂດຍການສະໜອງລະບົບນິເ"
"ວດທີ່ຄົບວົງຈອນ ເຊິ່ງອອກແບບມາສະເພາະເພື່ອຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງຕະຫຼອດເວລາຂອງອຸປະກອນເອເລັກໂຕຣ"
"ນິກມືສອງ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The operations detailed above lay a flawless foundation for a circular "
"economy business, but Odoo's integrated nature means you never have to stop "
"scaling."
msgstr ""
"ການດຳເນີນງານທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງເປັນການສ້າງພື້ນຖານທີ່ແຂງແກ່ນໃຫ້ແກ່ທຸລະກິດເສດຖະກິດໝູນວຽນ, ແຕ່ດ້ວຍລັກສະນ"
"ະການເຊື່ອມໂຍງລະບົບຂອງ Odoo ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍທຸລະກິດໄດ້ຢ່າງບໍ່ມີຂີດຈຳກັດ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Then add any valuable components you manage to extract (such as a working "
"camera module or pristine casing) into the by-products list."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນເພີ່ມຊິ້ນສ່ວນທີ່ມີມູນຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານແຍກອອກມາໄດ້ (ເຊັ່ນ: ໂມດູນກ້ອງທີ່ຍັງໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ ຫຼື ຝາຄອບທີ່ຢູ່ໃນສະພາບດີ) "
"ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການຜະລິດຕະພັນພອຍໄດ້."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid "Tips for Success"
msgstr "ເຄັດລັບສູ່ຄວາມສຳເລັດ"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model:product.attribute.value,name:electronic_refurbishment.product_attribute_value_1
msgid "To Qualify"
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າກວດສອບ"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_3
msgid ""
"Transform the way your team interacts with their data. Whether it's a quick "
"inventory check on the warehouse floor, setting a timer in the breakroom, or "
"pulling up daily KPIs during a morning stand-up, Hellodoo bridges the gap "
"between your physical workspace and your digital ERP."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນຮູບແບບການເຮັດວຽກກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທີມງານທ່ານ. ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນການກວດສອບສິນຄ້າໃນສາງຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ, ການຕັ້ງເ"
"ວລາໃນຫ້ອງພັກຜ່ອນ, ຫຼື ການເບິ່ງ KPI ປະຈຳວັນໃນການປະຊຸມຕອນເຊົ້າ, Hellodoo ຊ່ວຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງພື້ນທີ່"
"ເຮັດວຽກຕົວຈິງຂອງທ່ານກັບລະບົບ ERP ດິຈິຕອນ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Trigger product conversions on <b>any stock move</b>, allowing technicians "
"to instantly swap a device's identity as soon as it passes the testing bench."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດການປ່ຽນແປງສິນຄ້າໃນ <b>ການເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍສາງໃດກໍໄດ້</b>, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຊ່າງເຕັກນິກສາມາດປ່ຽນສະຖານະຂອງ"
"ອຸປະກອນໄດ້ທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກຜ່ານການທົດສອບ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Turning mystery boxes into valuable assets requires strict traceability. Our "
"technical conversion module empowers your team to seamlessly grade and "
"convert products, establishing the exact condition, value, and identity of "
"every device before it hits the shelves."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນກ່ອງສິນຄ້າທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ລາຍລະອຽດໃຫ້ເປັນສິນຄ້າມີມູນຄ່າ ຕ້ອງການການຕິດຕາມກວດສອບຢ່າງເຂັ້ມງວດ. ໂມດູນການ"
"ປ່ຽນແປງທາງເຕັກນິກຂອງພວກເຮົາ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທີມງານຂອງທ່ານຈັດເກຣດ ແລະ ປ່ຽນສະພາບສິນຄ້າໄດ້ຢ່າງສະດວກ, ກຳ"
"ນົດສະພາບ, ມູນຄ່າ ແລະ ຕົວຕົນທີ່ແນ່ນອນຂອງທຸກອຸປະກອນ ກ່ອນນຳອອກວາງຂາຍ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_6
msgid "Ultra-Wide &amp; Macro"
msgstr "ມຸມກວ້າງພິເສດ &amp; ມາໂຄຣ"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_10
msgid ""
"Ultra-soft leatherette earpads with memory foam contour your ears for total "
"ergonomic support and natural noise isolation."
msgstr ""
"ນວມຮອງຫູໜັງທຽມທີ່ນຸ້ມນວນພ້ອມເມໂມຣີໂຟມ ເຂົ້າກັບຮູບຊົງຫູຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອຄວາມສະບາຍຕາມຫຼັກສະຣີລະສາດ ແລະ "
"ຕັດສຽງລົບກວນໄດ້ຢ່າງເປັນທຳມະຊາດ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_3
msgid ""
"Unlike consumer smart speakers, Hellodoo processes business commands "
"securely. A dedicated hardware mute button ensures complete confidentiality "
"during sensitive discussions."
msgstr ""
"ຕ່າງຈາກລຳໂພງອັດສະລິຍະທົ່ວໄປ, Hellodoo ປະມວນຜົນຄຳສັ່ງທາງທຸລະກິດຢ່າງປອດໄພ. ປຸ່ມປິດສຽງແບບຮາດແວ"
"ສະເພາະ ຊ່ວຍຮັບປະກັນການຮັກສາຄວາມລັບໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົນທະນາເລື່ອງສຳຄັນ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_10
msgid "Up to 40 Hours Continuous Playback"
msgstr "ຫຼິ້ນໄດ້ຕໍ່ເນື່ອງສູງສຸດເຖິງ 40 ຊົ່ວໂມງ"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid "Use Cases"
msgstr "ກໍລະນີການນຳໃຊ້"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <b>Accounting app</b> to calculate your product margin over a "
"selected period, filtering\n"
"                specifically for products submitted to the <b>VAT margin "
"scheme</b> (excluding brand-new items)."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ <b>ແອັບການບັນຊີ</b> ເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ອັດຕາກຳໄລສິນຄ້າຂອງທ່ານໃນໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ເລືອກ, ໂດຍການກັ່ນຕອງ\n"
"                ເອົາສະເພາະສິນຄ້າທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ <b>ລະບົບອາກອນກຳໄລ (VAT margin scheme)</b> (ບໍ່"
"ລວມສິນຄ້າໃໝ່)."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <b>Sales app</b> or <b>eCommerce storefront</b> to list your fully "
"qualified and graded devices."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ <b>ແອັບການຂາຍ</b> ຫຼື <b>ໜ້າຮ້ານອີຄອມເມີຊ</b> ເພື່ອວາງຂາຍອຸປະກອນທີ່ຜ່ານການກວດສອບ ແລະ ຈັດ"
"ເກຣດຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <strong>Repair app</strong> to create dedicated repair orders by "
"selecting the exact product and its unique serial number."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ <strong>ແອັບການສ້ອມແປງ</strong> ເພື່ອສ້າງໃບສັ່ງສ້ອມສະເພາະ ໂດຍການເລືອກສິນຄ້າທີ່ແນ່ນອນ ແລ"
"ະ ໝາຍເລກລຳດັບສະເພາະຂອງມັນ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the scrap operation from inventory menu and from transfer to discard "
"devices which are not refurbish-able to maintain your stock neat and "
"accurate."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ການດຳເນີນການຕັດເປັນສິ່ງເສດເຫຼືອ (Scrap) ຈາກເມນູສາງສິນຄ້າ ແລະ ຈາກການໂອນຍ້າຍ ເພື່ອຖິ້ມອຸປະກອນ"
"ທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດປັບປຸງສະພາບໄດ້ ເພື່ອຮັກສາໃຫ້ສາງສິນຄ້າຂອງທ່ານເປັນລະບຽບ ແລະ ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Utilize the seamless <b>product conversions</b> directly from the inventory "
"replenishment screens."
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ລະບົບ <b>ການປ່ຽນແປງສິນຄ້າ</b> ທີ່ສະດວກສະບາຍ ໂດຍກົງຈາກໜ້າຈໍການເຕີມສິນຄ້າຄົງສາງ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model:account.tax,invoice_label:electronic_refurbishment.account_tax_1
#: model:account.tax,invoice_label:electronic_refurbishment.account_tax_2
#: model_terms:account.tax,description:electronic_refurbishment.account_tax_1
#: model_terms:account.tax,description:electronic_refurbishment.account_tax_2
msgid "VAT Margin Scheme"
msgstr "ລະບົບອາກອນມູນຄ່າເພີ່ມຈາກກຳໄລ"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:account.tax,invoice_legal_notes:electronic_refurbishment.account_tax_1
#: model_terms:account.tax,invoice_legal_notes:electronic_refurbishment.account_tax_2
msgid ""
"VAT Margin Scheme : Supply subject to the special margin scheme. VAT not "
"deductible."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບອາກອນມູນຄ່າເພີ່ມຈາກກຳໄລ: ການສະໜອງພາຍໃຕ້ລະບົບອັດຕາກຳໄລພິເສດ. ອາກອນມູນຄ່າເພີ່ມບໍ່ສາມາດຫັກໄ"
"ດ້."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model:product.public.category,name:electronic_refurbishment.product_public_category_6
msgid "Video games"
msgstr "ວິດີໂອເກມ"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.view_page_contactus
msgid "Visit Us"
msgstr "ເຂົ້າມາຢ້ຽມຊົມ"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_3
msgid "Voice-to-CRM Logging"
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກສຽງລົງສູ່ CRM"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.view_page_home
msgid "We collect used devices from businesses and individuals."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາຮັບຊື້ອຸປະກອນທີ່ໃຊ້ແລ້ວຈາກທຸລະກິດ ແລະ ບຸກຄົນທົ່ວໄປ."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.view_page_home
msgid ""
"We have a full range of Grade-A certified devices, fully restored and backed "
"by warranty."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາມີອຸປະກອນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຢັ້ງຢືນມາດຕະຖານ Grade-A ຄົບທຸກລຸ້ນ, ຜ່ານການຟື້ນຟູສະພາບຢ່າງສົມບູນ ແລະ ມີ"
"ການຮັບປະກັນ."

